        "text_VfQkrp": {
          "type": "text",
          "name": "t:names.text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>DTF Transfers can be peeled HOT OR COLD. Can be applied on to a variety of garments such as Cotton, Polyester, Poly Blend and much more.</p><p><strong>PRESSING INSTRUCTIONS (OUR RECOMMENDED SETTINGS):</strong></p><ol><li><strong>Turn on the heat press and set the heat to 275°F- 290°F at high pressure (75-90psi). Please calibrate your press to ensure proper temperature.</strong></li><li><strong>Press for 7-12 seconds. Please verify what time works best for your heat press.</strong></li><li><strong>While Instant Peel may be possible, our film is rated for Hot Peel (wait 3-5 seconds when the press pops open before peeling, best for solid artwork, we recommend cold peel for thinner lines and small details).</strong></li><li><strong>Repress with the same temp, pressure, and time using a finishing sheet.</strong></li></ol><p><strong>TIP: For Canvas material, change temp to 300F.</strong></p><h5><strong>For additional tips and instructions, reference the FAQ.</strong></h5><p><em>Disclaimer: Customers hold full copyright responsibility for all designs printed with us. Kindly ensure you have proper permission to use any copyrighted materials before submitting your artwork.</em></p>",
            "width": "100%",
            "max_width": "none",
            "alignment": "left",
            "type_preset": "rte",
            "font": "var(--font-body--family)",
            "font_size": "1rem",
            "line_height": "normal",
